      "message": "Hi, Ramji\n\nWith the lkft project, db845c_create_vendor_boot_img[1] is the function we used to regenerate the vendor_boot.img, and the vendor boot ramdisk is created via the recreate_ramdisk_with_kos[2] function defined there, all ko files(which should include the gki ko files) from the db845c build dist directory will be integrated into the ramdsik image. The vendor_boot.img recreation method should be the same as the AOSP build(if not, it needs to be updated.)\nNot sure if this is all you want?\n\n[1]: https://android-git.linaro.org/android-build-configs.git/tree/lkft/scripts/dragonboard.sh?h\u003dlkft#n445\n[2]: https://android-git.linaro.org/android-build-configs.git/tree/lkft/scripts/dragonboard.sh?h\u003dlkft#n29",
